<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 3pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 9pt">(2) With respect to each underlier, 75%
of its initial underlier value (rounded to three decimal places)</FONT></P>

