<P STYLE="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0">&nbsp;</P>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The following table sets forth the published high, low and period-end
closing levels of the NKY Index for each quarter for the period of January 4, 2019 through June 10, 2024. The associated graph shows the
closing levels of the NKY Index for each day in the same period. The closing level of the NKY Index on June 10, 2024 was 39,038.16. We
obtained the closing levels of the NKY Index from Bloomberg Professional<SUP>&reg;</SUP> service (&ldquo;Bloomberg&rdquo;), without independent
verification. Historical performance of the NKY Index should not be taken as an indication of future performance. Future performance of
the NKY Index may differ significantly from historical performance, and no assurance can be given as to the closing level of the NKY Index
during the term of the securities, including on any scheduled trading day during a determination period or on the final determination
date. We cannot give you assurance that the performance of the NKY Index will not result in a loss on your initial investment.</P>

